      "chunk_text": "Customer Meera Chauhan called insurance agent Anita Sharma to update her auto policy (AU-2026-0456). She increased her liability limit from $100k to $300k (adding $120/year) and lowered her deductible to $250 (adding $80/year). She also added her sister's 2022 Honda Civic and her sister as an additional driver ($30/month surcharge), bringing the new monthly premium to $112.50. The agent confirmed the changes and stated an e-signature link would be sent via email.",
